    "detailed_description": "<strong>Tactishia</strong><br>Tactical board game with some similarity to chess but uses more tactical aspects to simulate better a battlefield experience. The game has offline option as well as game lobbies for 1 vs 1 multiplayer. The game lets you choose up to 18 pieces of 6 types of units per board, the online session lets each players to re-organize the chosen pieces on each side of his board. The offline session lets any player to freely choose any pieces to use.",
